---
const anoAtual = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer
  class="relative bg-[var(--cor-fundo-suave)] text-[var(--cor-texto)] overflow-hidden border-t border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/25"
>
  <div
    class="absolute top-0 right-10 w-96 h-96 bg-[var(--cor-destaque)]/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-0"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute bottom-0 left-10 w-96 h-96 bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-0"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 z-10">
    <div
      class="py-16 lg:py-20 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start"
    >
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-start text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 mb-5">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)] flex items-center justify-center bg-white shadow-2xs"
          >
            <span
              class="font-serif text-lg font-normal text-[var(--cor-destaque)]"
              >K</span
            >
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col text-left">
            <span
              class="font-serif text-xl tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--cor-texto)] font-normal leading-tight"
            >
              KLASSY
            </span>
            <span
              class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)]"
            >
              Nails · Beauty · Mind
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p
          class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light leading-relaxed max-w-sm mb-6"
        >
          Centro de estética de referência em Valongo desde 2006 — unhas,
          depilação, olhar e bem-estar, pensados para o cuidado e serenidade de
          cada cliente.
        </p>

        <!-- REDES SOCIAIS COM RASTREIO DATA-REDE-SOCIAL -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <a
            data-rede-social="Instagram"
            href="https://www.instagram.com/klassy.pt/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Instagram"
            class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-[var(--cor-destaque)] border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/35 hover:border-[var(--cor-destaque)] text-[var(--cor-texto)] hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-2xs hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            IG
          </a>
          <a
            data-rede-social="Facebook"
            href="https://www.facebook.com/klassy.pt"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Facebook"
            class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-[var(--cor-destaque)] border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/35 hover:border-[var(--cor-destaque)] text-[var(--cor-texto)] hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-2xs hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            FB
          </a>
          <a
            data-rede-social="TikTok"
            href="https://www.tiktok.com/@klassypt"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="TikTok"
            class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-[var(--cor-destaque)] border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/35 hover:border-[var(--cor-destaque)] text-[var(--cor-texto)] hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-2xs hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            TK
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/351919786224"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="WhatsApp"
            class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-emerald-600 border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/35 hover:border-emerald-600 text-[var(--cor-texto)] hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-2xs hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            WA
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-3 flex flex-col items-start text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-5">
          <span class="w-4 h-px bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"></span>
          <span
            class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[var(--cor-texto)]"
          >
            Navegação
          </span>
        </div>

        <nav
          class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light"
        >
          <a
            href="/"
            class="hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Início
          </a>
          <a
            href="/services"
            class="hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Serviços
          </a>
          <a
            href="/about"
            class="hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Sobre Nós
          </a>
          <a
            href="/gallery"
            class="hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Galeria
          </a>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Contactos
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-start text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-5">
          <span class="w-4 h-px bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"></span>
          <span
            class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[var(--cor-texto)]"
          >
            Localização &amp; Marcações
          </span>
        </div>

        <div
          class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light mb-6"
        >
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Av. 5 de Outubro 72, Loja N · Edifício Vallis Longus<br />
            4440-503 Valongo, Porto
          </p>
          <a
            href="tel:+351919786224"
            class="block text-[var(--cor-texto)] hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] font-medium transition-colors"
          >
            +351 919 786 224
          </a>
          <a
            href="mailto:klassypt@gmail.com"
            class="block text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors"
          >
            klassypt@gmail.com
          </a>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://wa.me/351919786224?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C+gostaria+de+agendar+uma+marca%C3%A7%C3%A3o+na+Klassy."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[var(--cor-destaque)] hover:bg-[var(--cor-destaque-hover)] text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-[rgba(212,49,136,0.2)] hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current">
            <path
              d="M.057 24l1.687-6.163A11.867 11.867 0 0 1 .157 11.892C.16 5.335 5.495 0 12.05 0a11.82 11.82 0 0 1 8.413 3.48 11.82 11.82 0 0 1 3.48 8.413c-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892a11.9 11.9 0 0 1-5.683-1.448L.057 24zm6.547-3.893l.36.214a9.87 9.87 0 0 0 5.086 1.393c5.449 0 9.885-4.434 9.888-9.884a9.82 9.82 0 0 0-2.893-6.994 9.82 9.82 0 0 0-6.988-2.898c-5.452 0-9.887 4.435-9.888 9.884 0 1.884.524 3.714 1.516 5.289l.235.374-.999 3.65 3.681-.984z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Marcar por whatsapp</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="py-8 border-t border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/20 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-5 text-xs text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light"
    >
      <div
        class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2 text-center sm:text-left"
      >
        <p>
          &copy; {anoAtual} Klassy — Nails, Beauty &amp; Mind. Todos os direitos reservados.
        </p>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline text-[var(--cor-secundaria)]">·</span>
        <p>
          Desenvolvido por
          <a
            href="https://github.com/goncalosilvaa6"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-medium text-[var(--cor-texto)] hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors underline decoration-[var(--cor-secundaria)] underline-offset-2 ml-0.5"
          >
            Partecna
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 text-[11px]"
      >
        <a
          href="/terms"
          class="hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors"
        >
          Termos &amp; Condições
        </a>
        <span class="text-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/60">·</span>
        <a
          href="/privacy_cookies"
          class="hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors"
        >
          Privacidade &amp; Cookies
        </a>
        <span class="text-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/60">·</span>
        <a
          href="https://www.livroreclamacoes.pt/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors"
        >
          Livro de Reclamações
        </a>
      </div>

      <span
        class="text-center lg:text-right tracking-widest text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold text-[var(--cor-destaque)]"
      >
        Valongo · 2006–{anoAtual}
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
